[0.000624, "o", "\u001b[37mRAGme.io: Personal RAG Agent for Web Content\r\nA Comprehensive Overview\r\nMaximilien.ai\r\n\f 🎯 What is RAGme.io?\r\nRAGme.io is a personalized agent that uses Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) to\r\n... (truncated)\u001b[0m\r\n     2. \u001b[37;1mID\u001b[0m: \u001b[32m57f98d19-adfe-4ffe-b5a2-5fd9f0face23\u001b[0m\r\n        \u001b[37;1mContent\u001b[0m: \u001b[37m# Development workflow\r\n ./start.sh                    # Start all services\r\n ./start.sh compile-frontend   # Compile frontend after changes\r\n ./start.sh restart-backend    # Restart API, MCP, Agent\r\n ./start.sh restart-frontend   # Restart frontend only\r\n... (truncated)\u001b[0m\r\n     3. \u001b[37;1mID\u001b[0m: \u001b[32mff1ae991-a3fd-4097-aed6-7e5811fb1489\u001b[0m\r\n        \u001b[37;1mContent\u001b[0m: \u001b[37m2. Intelligent Query Processing\r\n flowchart LR\r\n     A[User Query] --> B[Language Detection]\r\n     B --> C[Query Classification]\r\n     C --> D[Agent Routing]\r\n... (truncated)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[37;1m📋\u001b[0m \u001b[37;1mSummary\u001b[0m\r\n   1. \u001b[37mREADME.md\u001b[0m - \u001b[33m1\u001b[0m chunks\r\n   2. \u001b[37mragme-io.pdf\u001b[0m - \u001b[33m3\u001b[0m chunks\r\n\r\n"]
